00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:54.060
the key ingredient is black bee propolis&nbsp;
extract propolis is bee glue it's used to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:58.320
seal up holes in hives it's made from plant&nbsp;
sap and it has some interesting properties&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:04.080
